// OmniAgent control plane (omni.control.v1).
//
// A stateless, multi-node gRPC tier in front of the FastAPI gateway replicas.
//
//   Router   (data plane)  Search, Chat (server streaming) and Vision dispatch
//                          to a healthy gateway, with the caller's deadline
//                          propagated to every upstream call, a request ID on
//                          every hop, bounded retries on another gateway, and
//                          graceful degradation instead of hard failures.
//   Cluster  (control)     node registration, heartbeats between peers, and
//                          exchange of each node's gateway health table so one
//                          node's failure detection reaches all of them.
//
// Node health is the standard grpc.health.v1 service, under the names
// "omni.control.v1.Router" and "omni.control.v1.Cluster".

